								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=751.msg6798#msg6798">Re:Good guild going bad</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #25 on:</b> April 07, 2004, 08:55:05 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I can see your point on that Labyrrinth and I&#039;m going to try to stay as objective as I can being that I am a member of Hegemony....<br /><br />Though not a &quot;continual flame using an anon name&quot;, &nbsp;I feel that the name was created for the sole purpose to damage the reputation of either Hegemony or Halius or both. &nbsp;<br /><br />In my opinion it is not a legitimate rant for this forum and it getting posted here was very bad form for the person who did it. &nbsp;It should have never been posted here and should have been handled internally within the guild.<br /><br />To me the post fractures what a guild is supposed to be. &nbsp;<br /><br />Not defending either side because I don&#039;t have all the facts myself, things are done and said in a different mindset in the &#039;heat of battle&#039; than they would be otherwise.<br /><br />It is my personal belief, that regardless of what guild this &#039;could&#039; have hapened in (and it could happen to any guild) &nbsp;that the &#039;offender&#039; that posted these &#039;internal matters&#039; to a public board should be dealt with appropriiately as there is a trust there that has been severly coomprimised possibly to the point of non recovery.<br /><br />I&#039;m kind of getting off topic here as a reply to Labyrrinth&#039;s post so I&#039;m goin to wrap up....<br /><br />Again I&#039;m trying to speak as just a player and not a member of Hege at this point. &nbsp;My veiws don&#039;t necessarily reflect those of the guild, this is just my opinion and should be treated as such.<br /><br />EDIT: Corrected spelling errors.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: April 07, 2004, 09:07:00 am by desai</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Desai Madidad <br />Cleric of Hegemony
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
