								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Somthing link=board=10;threadid=751;start=15#msg6796 date=1081341000</div><div class="quote">Ssnakess, I believe you are mistaken. &nbsp;Those logs that are shown are copied over from our message boards, so that is not proof of who it was.<br /></div><br />It&#039;s not total proof, but if you look at what those tells are about, the manner of speech in the tells, and then the manner of speech in the post...there is a good chance that they are the same person.<br /><br />But whatever, missing your spot in CH rotation happens all the time, in every guild. &nbsp;Pretty funny that someone is getting so upset over it unless of course the person in question misses their spot in CH chain time and time again.<br /><br />Missing your spot is far better than dying. &nbsp;And of course, missing your spot to heal yourself is a lot better than CHing the wrong tank over and over and over while being told to switch (cough, name starts with a J).<br /><br />Oh and, personally, I don&#039;t see a reason to ban the anon poster unless the logs of private guild-only forums continue to be posted by the same account/IP.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
