						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=751.msg6806#msg6806"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=751.msg6806#msg6806">Re:Good guild going bad</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #28 on:</b> April 07, 2004, 01:50:01 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I agree with you there Ssnakess. &nbsp;The &quot;perception&quot; that is was Halius is there, but no defined proof. &nbsp;It could&#039;ve been someone who doesn&#039;t like him and wants to see him gone from Hegemony.<br /><br />Either way, I think we both get the gist.
