							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Kweil link=board=10;threadid=751;start=15#msg6804 date=1081356215</div><div class="quote">You forgot the last rule:<br />The admins and moderators are allowed to be human and exersice what they feel is good judgement. &nbsp;We also reserve the right to smack any dipshits that try to quote the rules back to us.<br /></div><br />Well at least there&#039;s no doubt about who the asshole is of this thread,,, is there Kweil? &nbsp;Someone questions the &quot;rules&quot; and you immediately go into name calling..... &nbsp;<br /><br />Again, as far as the rules go - if you want to loosely interpet and loosely define them as you see fit, then by all means - go for it. &nbsp;The only thing I questioned and didn&#039;t agree with is the &quot;changing them on the fly&quot;... but &nbsp;again,, whatever<br /><br />This board is about dead as it is... &nbsp;if you havent&#039; figured it out yet, anon postings, board trolls and drama are what keep boards going and make them interesting. &nbsp;Un-anon top ten guild lists will only carry you so far...
						</td>
					</tr>
